\fIserializer\fP Destination writer; its resource mode selects the representation\&. Frame layout, opacity, edge clamping and subsection selection are included\&. Anonymous runtime images and modified pixels embed in either mode\&. This writes a raw record; restore it by calling \fBImage::deserialize()\fP on an existing image\&. 
.RE
